{#
  The footer every page of this module carries, and the reason it does.

  Nothing on these pages is fresher than the last Desk import: the module
  stores no state of its own and recomputes everything from the imported
  roster on each request. Stating the import date turns "this is the
  situation" into "this was the situation on that date", which is the only
  claim the data supports — and the difference matters most exactly when it
  is easiest to forget, three weeks after an import.

  The rules version and its verification date answer the other question a
  reader eventually asks: not "is this data current?" but "is this RULE
  current?". Both come from Modules\Leadership\LeadershipRules.

  Usage:
  {% include '@leadership/partials/_validity_footer.html.twig' with {
      scout_year_label: scout_year_label,
      last_import_at: last_import_at,
      rules_version: rules_version,
      rules_verified_on: rules_verified_on,
  } only %}
#}
<div class="small text-body-secondary border-top pt-3 mt-4">
    <p class="mb-1">
        <i class="bi bi-clock-history" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        {% if last_import_at %}
            Données de l'année scoute {{ scout_year_label }}, telles qu'importées de Desk le {{ last_import_at|datetime_fr }}.
            Tout changement encodé dans Desk depuis cette date n'apparaît pas ici.
        {% else %}
            Année scoute {{ scout_year_label }} : aucun import Desk n'a encore été enregistré pour cette année.
            Les listes ci-dessus sont donc calculées sur des données incomplètes.
        {% endif %}
    </p>
    <p class="mb-0">
        <i class="bi bi-rulers" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        Seuils appliqués : version {{ rules_version }}, vérifiés le {{ rules_verified_on|date_fr }}.
    </p>
</div>
